AsciiDoc
description: text/asciidoc - Asciidoctor-rendered, same link treaty as Markdown
- >
  An `.adoc` file renders through Asciidoctor, with `§` heading anchors and KaTeX math, the
  same reading surface Markdown gets.
- >
  The [link treaty](*..:markdown) is identical: relative file paths only, made navigable by
  the renderer, never scanned, rewritten, or doctor-checked by the engine. A move may break
  them; the author owns them.
